name scrlayer-fancyhdr
category Package
revision 63844
shortdesc Combining package fancyhdr with KOMA-Script's scrlayer
longdesc This LaTeX package uses KOMA-Script's scrlayer to redefine the
longdesc page styles of package fancyhdr. This allows the combination of
longdesc features of fancyhdr with features of scrlayer. Before
longdesc KOMA-Script v3.33 scrlayer-fancyhdr was part of KOMA-Script
longdesc itself.
